      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T08:14:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with your concern. I asked whether we can expect llvm to have the previous behavior where we don\u0027t need wrapper in https://crbug.com/542981236#comment14\n\nGemini proposed some other solutions like\n1. extend `generated_file` to support linker inputs collection\n1. support copying response file from other target\n\nBut I feel this solution is simpler and have some similarity with `write_runtime_deps`. So I asked Gemini to implement this feature.\n\nIt is bit hard to decide which of extensibility or simplicity is important here, but if we don\u0027t have ohter use case of extensibility, I prefer to have simpler interface for now.",
